children.translated_text:
a dharmical conversation, rich in meaning,
was brought up by the <s>bhikṣus</s> in the <s>Maṇḍalavāṭa</s>;
he heard it with the divine ear element,

body.translated_text:
Just as the flame of a fire fed with abundant fuel,
fanned by the force of the wind;
even so this <s>upādā</s>

should resort to [metrical lacuna] lodging and seat;
and there he should dwell here, diligent,
[metrical lacuna].
